    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"evolving.\" it's like the spark is totally gone. it's just noise now. i look at my old stuff and it's brilliant, and then i look at what i'm doing today and it's just... embarrassing. i'd rather just stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
